From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.security.enterprisedata: the asynchronous requests of ProtectionPolicyManager (3717)

windows.security.enterprisedata: the asynchronous requests of ProtectionPolicyManager

Every RequestAccess*Async answers Allowed, IsFileProtectionRequired*Async
false and the endpoint identity query an empty string, as IAsyncOperation
objects that are completed at once (IAsyncInfo, handlers, Close). The IDL
now spells the real result types. GetIids/GetRuntimeClassName/GetTrustLevel
for the manager, context and factory.
---
